.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH geectl-build-dependson 1  "geectl-build-dependson 0.2.3" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-build\-dependson \- List which packages each package depends on for its build
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl build dependson\fR [\fB\-\-package\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> <\fIREPOSITORY\fR> <\fIARCH\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List which packages each package depends on for its build
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-package\fR \fI<PACKAGE>\fR
Only this package\*(Aqs dependencies
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project the repository is in
.TP
<\fIREPOSITORY\fR>
The repository to read
.TP
<\fIARCH\fR>
The architecture to read
.SH VERSION
v0.2.3
